@startuml
' A floating note stands beside its action as every note does; a note
' before the first action of its flow is that action's, one after a group
' its last action's.
start
:Open the shop;
floating note left: Every morning
partition Counter {
  note
    Before anyone comes
  end note
  :Count the till;
  :Unlock the door;
}
note right: Then it is open
stop
@enduml
